 r4 | 15.5 | hours | current |\n| PWR-043 | lab | r4 | 16.2 | hours | current |\n| PWR-044 | radio | r4 | 16.9 | hours | current |\n| PWR-045 | Plant-A | r4 | 14.5 | hours | current |\n| PWR-046 | Plant-B | r4 | 15.2 | hours | current |\n| PWR-047 | P-4 | r4 | 15.9 | hours | current |\n\n## Decision constraints\n\nUse the observed seventeen-hour delay, not the eight-hour contract target, unless a repair is currently verified.\nState consumption, staging, supplier, route, replenishment trigger, and coupled effects.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
